        "name": "What is a good 40-yard dash time?",
        "acceptedAnswer": {
          "@type": "Answer",
          "text": "It depends on position and level. At the NFL combine, the average is about 4.47 to 4.53 seconds for cornerbacks, receivers, running backs and safeties, about 4.7 for linebackers, tight ends and quarterbacks, and 5.0 to 5.15 for linemen. For high school varsity skill players, 4.70 to 4.85 is average and under 4.50 is elite."
