---
<header>
<p class="eyebrow">Free Football Speed Tool</p>
<h1>40-Yard Dash<span>Calculator</span></h1>
<p class="subtitle">Enter your 40 time and position to see your percentile against high school players and NFL combine prospects, your hand-time conversion, mph and Speed Score.</p>
</header><div class="container">
<div class="links-row">
<a class="site-link" href="/sprint-speed-calculator">
      ↑ <strong>Sprint Speed</strong> Percentile Calculator
    </a>
<a class="site-link" href="/broad-jump-sprint-speed-calculator">
      ↑ <strong>Broad Jump</strong> to 40 Time Calculator
    </a>
</div>
<div class="card">
<p class="card-label">Your 40-Yard Dash</p>
<div class="format-tabs">
<button class="format-tab active" type="button" onclick="setTiming('laser', this)">Electronic / Laser</button>
<button class="format-tab" type="button" onclick="setTiming('hand', this)">Hand-Timed</button>
</div>
<div class="form-grid">
<div class="field full">
<label for="t40">40-Yard Dash Time (seconds)</label>
<input id="t40" max="8" min="3.8" placeholder="e.g. 4.65" step="0.01" type="number" inputmode="decimal"/>
</div>
<div class="field">
<label for="pos">Position</label>
<select id="pos">
<option value="ALL">Any position</option>
<option value="WR">Wide Receiver</option>
<option value="CB">Cornerback</option>
<option value="RB">Running Back</option>
<option value="S">Safety</option>
<option value="LB">Linebacker</option>
<option value="QB">Quarterback</option>
<option value="TE">Tight End</option>
<option value="DE">Defensive End / Edge</option>
<option value="DT">Defensive Tackle</option>
<option value="OL">Offensive Guard / Tackle</option>
<option value="C">Center</option>
</select>
</div>
<div class="field">
<label for="level">Compare Against</label>
<select id="level">
<option value="hs">High School Varsity</option>
<option value="nfl" selected="">NFL Combine</option>
</select>
</div>
<div class="field full">
<label for="wt">Bodyweight in lbs (optional, for Speed Score)</label>
<input id="wt" max="400" min="90" placeholder="e.g. 205" step="1" type="number" inputmode="numeric"/>
</div>
</div>
<button class="calc-btn" type="button" onclick="calculate()">Rate My 40 Time →</button>
</div>
<div id="results">
<div class="gauge-card anim anim-d1">
<div class="conversions-row" id="conversions-row"></div>
<svg class="gauge-svg" style="display:block;margin:0 auto 1.5rem;width:260px;height:140px;" viewbox="0 0 260 140">
<path class="gauge-track" d="M 20 130 A 110 110 0 0 1 240 130"></path>
<path class="gauge-fill" d="M 20 130 A 110 110 0 0 1 240 130" id="gauge-path" stroke="var(--accent)" stroke-dasharray="345" stroke-dashoffset="345"></path>
<text fill="var(--accent)" font-family="'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif" font-size="62" font-weight="900" id="gauge-num" text-anchor="middle" x="130" y="108">—</text>
<text fill="var(--text-muted)" font-family="'DM Mono', monospace" font-size="10" letter-spacing="2" text-anchor="middle" x="130" y="128">PERCENTILE</text>
</svg>
<div class="verdict" id="verdict">—</div>
<div class="verdict-sub" id="verdict-sub">—</div>
